script 5 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Ice
	"어디선가 본 적\n있는 것 같은데…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	"흠, 그럴 리가."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Ice
	"그러니까, 날 도와줄\n수 있다는 말이지…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	"방금 네 말을 엿들었거든…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"정말 미소라와\n록맨을 눈앞에서\n치워 버리고 싶다면…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"내가 그렇게 만들어 줄게."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Ice
	"어, 어떻게?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Jack
	"이 노이즈 카드로!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"너에게 「다이아몬드」라는\n칭호를 주겠어!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	msgClose
	end
}
